      en: ["Crosses the Katonga River on the Kampala-Masaka highway.", "In May 2023, the bridge was severely damaged by heavy floods.", "Connects Kampala to southwestern Uganda and neighbouring countries.", "A new, more resilient bridge is currently under construction.", "The Katonga River flows into both Lake Victoria and Lake George.", "The bridge is located near the Katonga Wildlife Reserve."],
